      "finding_id": "BA11-R4-RR-P0-001",
      "required_fix": "Separate candidate/staged ledger objects from published ledger authority, or make the publication rail explicitly distinguish reachable published heads from unreferenced content-addressed candidates. A pre-swap crash must not poison or fork later valid work.",
      "requirement_ids": [
        "T-R5-001-A",
        "T-R5-001-B",
        "T-R5-001-C"
      ],
      "root_cause": "commit_transaction writes registry/debt ledger heads and sets into the same directories that _read_persistent_ledger later treats as published authority before the registry head swap. A crash before_head_swap leaves an unreferenced candidate head there.",
