      "finding_id": "BA11-R4-RR-P0-002",
      "required_fix": "RegistryAuthorityGraph must identify the current promotion event by exact event hash / candidate binding, not by requiring it to be the only promotion event in history. Historical PromotionEvents remain valid append-only evidence.",
      "requirement_ids": [
        "T-R5-002-A",
        "T-R5-002-B",
        "T-R5-002-C"
      ],
      "root_cause": "_promotion_event requires exactly one PromotionEvent in objects.registry_events, while registry_events simultaneously represent the full append-only ledger used to derive the snapshot and ledger head. A second legitimate candidate/review/approval/promotion cycle therefore produces two historical PromotionEvents and is rejected.",
